#: ../../versioning.rst:6
msgid ""
"This page states what the version numbers of ANet promise, which "
"compatibility surfaces exist and how a change reaches users."
msgstr "本页说明 ANet 的版本号作出何种承诺、存在哪些兼容性面，以及变更如何到达用户。"

