#: ../../versioning.rst:40
msgid ""
"``anet version`` prints the version, the commit, the time of the build "
"and the modules that are compiled into the binary. ``anet-hub --version``"
" prints the release, the hub wire version and the first ``anet`` release "
"that speaks it."
