"``anet version`` 输出版本、提交、构建时间以及编译进二进制文件的模块。\\ ``anet-hub --version`` "
"输出发布版本、Hub 线路版本以及首个支持该线路版本的 ``anet`` 发布版本。"

#: ../../versioning.rst:46
msgid "Compatibility surfaces"
msgstr "兼容性面"

#: ../../versioning.rst:48
msgid ""
"Compatibility is defined per surface, each with its own version that is "
"checked at run time."
msgstr "兼容性按面定义，每个面各有一个在运行时检查的版本。"

#: ../../versioning.rst:54
msgid "Surface"
msgstr "面"

#: ../../versioning.rst:55
msgid "Version in 0.3"
msgstr "0.3 中的版本"

