msgstr "随每个请求和响应发送。取值不同时以 ``wire_too_old``\\ （426）或 ``wire_too_new``\\ （400）拒绝。"

#: ../../versioning.rst:61
msgid "Sealed envelope"
msgstr "封缄信封"

#: ../../versioning.rst:62
